Z||000000||DisfourDan||06-20-2001||11:15 PM||||Hey guys, I have been away for awhile. Anyways, I found a Fiero, here are the stats<BR>Description: FIERO GT.... V-6... 2.8 L. FOUR SPEED... IN GOOD CONDITION... RUNS VERY STRONG!! AC WORKS TOO! PW.. ALLOYS.. NEW TIRES/CATALYST AND O2 SENSOR....... STEREO...... CLICK ON ADDITIONAL INFORMATION TO SEE PHOTOS!! WILL SHIP THIS CAR ANYWHERE IN THE U.S. FOR $350. <BR>Features: Sunroof · Power Windows · Air Conditioning <BR>Date Posted: 06/20/01 <BR>Sold As: By Owner <BR>Price: $ 1,200.00 (Best Offer) <BR>Category: Fiero <BR>Color: White <BR>Mileage: 125,000 <BR>Condition: Used <BR>I asked if there was anything damage to the car or the engine, and the only thing he said was wrong was that there was a slight leak in the exhaust in the front of the engine (manifold, i believe). <P>I am having my brother check it out, anything he should look for?<P>------------------<BR>Nothing good can come from good.||||reg||1
