Z||000006||fyerstarter||06-21-2001||12:02 AM||||Looks in pretty nice condition. How many miles? You may want to have a mechnic look at it and test drive it with you if you know one. I just say this because $1200 obo is a pretty low price for that car in decent condition, especially in California. And many times what people think is an exhaust leak in the front manifold turns out to be knocking in the valvetrain or rod bearings going out. ||||reg||1
Z||000007||Oreif||06-21-2001||12:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Songman:<BR><B>Sorry about that.. thought the 5-speeds came in 86...<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They did come in 86 but it was late 86. Some GT's and SE's got the 5-spd. I think it was the ones built end of May thru June. I am not positive how many 86's actually got them or numbers (GT vs SE).<P>By the way do you still have your GTO Judge?<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
