Z||000013||Fiero5||06-21-2001||11:40 AM||||Dude, that is a great buy on that 85GT, especially if all that is wrong is an exhaust leak. We had the same problem on two of our V6's. It is not that hard to fix. I am going to go out a limb here and say that if you pass on it now, you are going to shoot yourself later. An exhaust leak on a V6 is not uncommon. You could easily spend alot more on one that currently doesn't have the leak, and still run into that problem at some point.<P>How does the interior look?<P>Steve||||reg||12
