Z||000015||Oreif||06-21-2001||12:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DisfourDan:<BR><B>I got an email back from the owner of the fiero, he said that the leak in the front manifold must be fixed, because the car did not pass its smog test.  I think I will pass on this car, unless the repair for the exhaust leak is cheap and easy, which it probably isnt.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The leak can be repaired easily! If all else fails Email Chris West and get a set of Shorty Headers from him. Even with the $300 for the shorty headers the car is still a good deal.<P>||||reg||4
